{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_title":true,"page_width":"medium"}},"22b83c68-19e6-4bd6-b918-9b50fa41c065":{"type":"presskit-hero-banner","settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"section_height":"auto","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rectangle_1_1.png","subheading":"","title":"Grillbot Press Kit","content":"<p>The Barbecue Grill Cleaning Brush<\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","link_style":"link","background_type":"full_width","text_width":"large","text_position":"middle_center","show_press_btn":true,"pdf_link":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0337\/8629\/files\/Grillbot_PPT_WS.pdf?15957048547884280921","text_color":"#ffffff","button_background":"#ffffff","button_text_color":"#000000","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":30}},"fd0eb10b-0283-448d-926d-9d4ff9df8ad6":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"subheading":"","title":"HANDS-FREE GRILL CLEANING IS HERE!","content":"<p>Grillbot is an innovative, fully-automated device that makes grill cleaning easy with a push of a button saving grillers time from the grime. Designed for use on any-style grill, consumers simply place the Grillbot on the grill, press a button and the Grillbot does all the cleaning.<\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","background_type":"full_width","text_width":"fill","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_class":""}},"083475df-ec8d-4cc2-8c12-6ab38fe73cca":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--14590306254911__083475df-ec8d-4cc2-8c12-6ab38fe73cca-1681709328769fc73a-0":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rectangle_24_377aed7c-6178-4a81-bf10-f2e7ea4aa442.png","tab_label":"Item","subheading":"","title":"About Grillbot","title_small":"","content":"<p>As with most inventions, Grillbot began with an idea. One day, founder Ethan Woods was getting ready to use his grill and did not have a brush available to clean it.<br\/>While trying to clean a stubborn grill with a wire brush, he wondered if a robot could be created to do the job.<br\/>He took a power drill, attached a brush and cleaned the grill. He put together a design team and that makeshift drill became the sophisticated computer driven Grillbot. Ethan and his family are excited to bring this new innovative device to the world.<\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14590306254911__083475df-ec8d-4cc2-8c12-6ab38fe73cca-1681709328769fc73a-0"],"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"full_width","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"left","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"}},"63ed359c-0936-4fe2-aca0-43b83b23c5fb":{"type":"grillbot-countries","blocks":{"04308e2c-c67e-49d3-93b0-346552b6af2f":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_1.png","text_flag":"Denmark","url_link":"#"}},"b60af64a-adaa-45e0-aadc-5fe1d02bfa78":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_2.png","text_flag":"France","url_link":"#"}},"8580d13b-50a7-40b5-bead-ecbeed54b90e":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_3.png","text_flag":"Sweden","url_link":"#"}},"cd6a486c-e6d2-4b62-a605-7c3358c5e74c":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_4.png","text_flag":"Switzerland","url_link":""}},"c0981dda-710e-4d0f-9bd8-3dd7221f6987":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_5.png","text_flag":"Australia","url_link":""}},"8fe8c53e-bded-4629-8a34-9f4cf3d93b1b":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_flag":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_6.png","text_flag":"Czech Republic","url_link":""}},"2acc5f1e-6a21-469d-a103-194824edea69":{"type":"block","settings":{"image_fl